+ *  GLFW_INVALID_ENUM, @ref GLFW_INVALID_VALUE, @ref GLFW_API_UNAVAILABLE, @ref
+ *  GLFW_VERSION_UNAVAILABLE, @ref GLFW_FORMAT_UNAVAILABLE, @ref
